        "title": "Language Targets",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Language Targets",
          "Aspects Examples 1 Talk about general past events. They were at home last night. / We visited our grandma two weeks ago. 2 Historical events. WWII ended in 1945. / Venezuela got independent on July the 5th, 1810. 3 Narrate events The boy entered the room and saw everything was stolen...",
          "When using past simple structure we may be talking about different aspects or functions.",
          "TO CONSIDER Time phrases are very important, no matter the function or aspect covered."
        ],
